OL,3,AApple unsure when it will get more
OL,4,Afoldable iPhones ahead of Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, Apple's new chief executive
OL,7,FJohn Ternus said the firm was seeing an
OL,8,F"unprecedented" price rise in memory
OL,9,Fcosts, including chips, as the
OL,10,Fartificial intelligence (AI) industry
OL,11,Fcontinues to invest billions of dollars
OL,12,Fin building data centres.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
