OL,3,ANorth Korea denies being behind record
OL,4,A$6.3bn Binance hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth Korea has denied claims that it
OL,7,Fwas behind the record $6.3bn (#4.7bn)
OL,8,Fhack of cryptocurrency exchange
OL,9,FBinance, calling the allegations
OL,10,F"absurd rhetoric".
OL,12,FKim Yo Jong, a top Democratic People's
OL,13,FRepublic of Korea official and the
OL,14,Fsister of leader Kim Jong Un, said on
OL,15,FTuesday that the accusations are
OL,16,Fanother "sinister attempt" by the US to
OL,17,Fdamage Pyongyang's public image.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11908
SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1793719106
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ANorth Korea denies being behind record
OL,4,A$6.3bn Binance hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US Federal Bureau of Investigation
OL,7,F(FBI), the Secret Service and cyber
OL,8,Fanalysts have said North Korea
OL,9,Forchestrated the hack, which has been
OL,10,Fdescribed as the largest in history.
OL,12,FThis is the latest hack to be linked to
OL,13,FNorth Korea, which has been accused of
OL,14,Frelying on cyber-crime to help finance
OL,15,Fits sanctioned economy.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
